  "description": "一只不剩",
  "body_html": "<p><em>本文介绍了一种非常有效的灭蚊方法。可以一只不剩地消灭室内的蚊子，而且人畜无害。这篇文章挺长，介绍了整个故事和原理，并且揭露了一些智商税。如果你只想尽快知道这个方法，请跳转到最后的“<strong>解决方案</strong>”。</em></p><p>夏天来了，蚊子多起来了。特别是绿化比较好的地方。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg\" width=\"400\" height=\"266\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:266,&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:16143,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://yinwang1.substack.com/i/206400801?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!shcV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb39e7969-f87a-4c8f-8268-7b5f80b0414d_400x266.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h1>狡猾的蚊子</h1><p>我已经很仔细地检查了纱窗的密封，确保没有蚊子可以从窗户进入，但每隔几天还是有那么一两只蚊子进到家里。白天不容易看见它们，晚上睡觉时它们就开始叮人，很是影响睡眠。</p><p>这些蚊子相当的狡猾，不像以前遇到的那种傻蚊子，会飞到你耳朵边上。只要那时候起来开灯，就会看到蚊子在附近歇着，然后我就会很准确地把它们拍死。</p><p>我是怎么拍蚊子的？拿一卷报纸，然后用我顶级的“网球单反” :)</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"389\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/dbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:389,&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:237874,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://yinwang1.substack.com/i/206400801?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AzX_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbb10f7e-bafc-4789-a54e-7bac441729f9_400x389.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>现在遇到的这些蚊子，已经聪明到不飞到你耳朵边上。它们知道那样会吵醒你，你就会起来把它们打死。所以它们总是离你的头远远的，只咬腿，脚，手之类的地方。</p><p>等你意识到有蚊子，应该已经被咬了几下了。你终于决定起来开灯，却找不到它们。因为它们已经躲到你不容易看清的地方去了，比如床下面。</p><h1>蚊香不是好的解决方案</h1><p>很多人遇到这种情况，可能就会使用蚊香。</p><p>我也买了雷达电蚊香，结果发现基本不管用。开很久那蚊子还在。</p><p>可能传统的点火的蚊香会有效一些，但我发现现在的蚊香都不是天然草药造的，里面的有效成分其实都是菊酯一类的东西，都是毒药。</p><p>把蚊香点在卧室里，整晚吸入除虫菊酯，闻着难受不说，我不知道长此以往是什么后果。</p><p>毕竟菊酯是毒药。虽然对人畜毒性很小，但每晚不停地吸入这东西，这个量就累积起来了。谁知道以后会导致什么后果呢？</p><p>所以我一般都不用蚊香。</p><h1>日本金鸟灭蚊喷雾（智商税）</h1><p>几年前在上海的时候，我买过一种“日本金鸟灭蚊喷雾”。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/aa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:400,&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:69127,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://yinwang1.substack.com/i/206400801?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gAyh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa7850c9-bac3-426f-b204-b22eb0e0f93c_400x400.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>说得很神奇的样子，说一间房间只需要一喷。这喷雾里的物质就会扩散吸附在墙壁和窗帘之类的物体上。蚊子在墙上歇脚接触到这毒药，就会被毒死。</p><p>日本人的一贯做法：这瓶子超级小。而且给你固定了可以喷的数量，一瓶大概是200喷。一瓶价格是 50 元以上，所以单位价格是相当贵的。</p><p>在上海时用的时候，似乎是有效的。反正喷了过一会好像蚊子就没了。但这次再买来，发现它对云南的蚊子是不管用的。一喷不行，喷好几下，居然也不行。</p><p>有一天晚上我起来好几趟，想除掉那讨厌的蚊子。用金鸟喷了好几下，蚊子居然还在。最后我终于看到蚊子在墙上。我拿着金鸟的罐子，正对着这蚊子一喷。虽然它被喷得踉跄了一下，结果还是飞走了…… 所以看来，根本不管用！</p><p>直接对着蚊子喷都弄不死它，你还指望这药扩散到那么大面积的墙壁上，等蚊子歇脚的时候毒死它？扩散后的浓度已经多低了，显然不可行啊。</p><p>所以金鸟看来是智商税。</p><h1>农药</h1><p>虽然金鸟对厉害的蚊子不管用，但它的设计理念却是正确的：蚊子总会在墙壁之类的地方歇脚，它不会一直飞在空中。如果你在它可能歇脚的地方喷上某种持久的毒药，它的浓度达到一定的程度（不像金鸟那么低），那么蚊子歇脚的时候就会中毒。</p><p>这样的毒药存在吗？当然，它已经存在很久了。它的名字叫“农药”。</p><p>想想农场是如何防治虫害的？他们喷洒农药在作物上。这些农药不会扩散到空气里，都是接触性的毒药。害虫爬到植物上，接触到农药，就中毒死了。</p><p>这不就正好是金鸟灭蚊的理念吗！</p><p>所以虽然金鸟不真的管用，但农药应该可以。如果你喷足够浓度的农药在墙壁上，蚊子在上面歇脚，就会中毒死掉。即使不立即毙命，也会慢性中毒而死。</p><p>根据这个启发，我买来了一款低毒的农药——呋虫胺。它无色无味，不会挥发到空气里。只需要 0.5% 以下的浓度，喷在蚊子可能歇脚的地方就行。墙角，床底，窗台，窗帘，门口外侧，等等。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"836\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:836,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1562274,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://yinwang1.substack.com/i/206400801?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rVka!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa49a87f3-41e1-46eb-9373-e24d16ae70f0_2255x1294.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>有意思的是，呋虫胺也是日本人发明的。如果你从卖农药的网店买颗粒剂，自己兑水稀释，它的单位价格可以非常低。</p><p>我估计日本的房子里蚊虫这么少，可能就是物业喷了这类农药在公共区域的墙上。有些国人以为那是因为日本干净，所以蚊子少，我发现不是那个原因。</p><p>日本的公园里蚊子超级多的，夏天坐在东京某些公园的椅子上，可能立即被咬得全身是包，落荒而逃！所以室内应该是喷了农药的，蚊子才不会进到家里。</p><p>然而日本人却卖金鸟这种智商税到国外，骗大家只需要一喷就能扩散到全屋墙壁上，还能有效……</p><p>金鸟的主要成分是菊酯（估计是氯菊酯），那也是农药。如果菊酯喷的量够了，也会有效。但那么丁点大的瓶子，只喷一下，当然不会有用。</p><h1>解决方案</h1><p>所以终极解决方案就是：农药。能杀飞虫的农药应该都行。</p><p>把低毒农药（比如呋虫胺，菊酯等）兑水到合适的浓度，用雾化喷瓶喷在蚊子可能歇脚的地方。比如墙角，床底，窗台，窗帘，门口外侧，等等。蚊子飞了一会在上面歇脚，就会接触中毒而死。</p><p>我目前使用的是呋虫胺。你也可以尝试其它的农药，但请先咨询客服它有没有气味，对人畜毒性如何。菊酯类的农药好像会有一点点气味。</p><p>喷洒农药的时候，喷嘴应该尽量接近墙壁，薄薄喷一层就行。尽量避免喷在半空中，否则雾滴容易被吸入。如果房子面积很大，应该考虑用专业的农药喷雾器，因为它有一根长杆子，可以避免把药喷在半空中。</p><p>喷洒时应该戴口罩，避免吸入，避免接触皮肤和眼睛。虽然这些农药是低毒的，而且不会挥发到空气里。但你喷雾的时候还是可能吸入到肺里，虽然不会立即有危险，这对身体当然也不大好的，所以应该尽量避免。</p><p>一旦喷雾沉降结束，农药会附着在墙壁上（干了之后作为一种晶体存在），就不会再挥发到空气里了。那时候就可以取下口罩，放心呼吸了。</p><p>由于蚊子很小，容易毒死，你可能不需要杀蝗虫或蟑螂那么大的昆虫需要的浓度。呋虫胺的标准浓度是0.5%，你可以考虑再加一些水试试。但不要太低，否则可能无效。</p><p>特别有意思的是，我发现喷在大门外面的墙上会挺有用。因为聪明的蚊子会埋伏在你家门口的墙壁上，等你一开门它们就飞进屋里。所以把农药喷在门口的墙上，它们就没法埋伏在那里了。</p><p>喷药之后几天，我发现门口的地上有几只死掉的蚊子。要是我没喷药在门口，它们可能就趁我开门的机会飞进屋里了。</p><p>使用这个方案，就能很省心的消灭家里所有的蚊子，并防止蚊子从大门进入。而且只要喷一次，药效会持续几个月，都不会有蚊子。简直可以说是一劳永逸。</p><h1>不要用百货店卖的杀虫剂</h1><p>另外需要注意的是，百货店卖的那种罐装的“家用杀虫剂”（比如“雷达”，“超威”之类的）虽然里面也是菊酯一类的农药，但它们添加了很多的香精和其它挥发性物质。这些“香味”会停留在空气里，持久不散，闻着非常难受，很可能对人体有毒。</p><p>所以请不要用百货店卖的杀虫剂来做这个灭蚊操作。一定要买专业的，纯正的农药。真正的农药比“家用杀虫剂”味道要轻很多，甚至完全没有气味，喷洒后完全不会被人畜吸入。</p><p>所以“农药”虽然名字吓人，其实比“家用杀虫剂”安全很多。</p><h1>有效付费</h1><p>这是我经过很多辛苦和研究才得来的方案。如果这个方案完美的解决了你的问题，希望你能为此付费。可以使用以下二维码，数量随意。付款请留言“灭蚊方法有效”，这样我看了会很高兴。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OqQd!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd02799e9-46c7-4782-8415-c294c23211e0_400x600.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OqQd!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd02799e9-46c7-4782-8415-c294c23211e0_400x600.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OqQd!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd02799e9-46c7-4782-8415-c294c23211e0_400x600.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OqQd!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd02799e9-46c7-4782-8415-c294c23211e0_400x600.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OqQd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd02799e9-46c7-4782-8415-c294c23211e0_400x600.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"h